# Portfolio Conventions

## Scope

Minimal, focused diffs. Match existing patterns in neighboring files before introducing new abstractions.

## Imports & paths

- Use `@/` alias (e.g. `@/components/ui/section-heading`).
- Prefer named exports for section and UI components.

## Styling

- Tailwind CSS v4 with theme tokens from `app/globals.css` (`--background`, `--foreground`, `--primary`, etc.).
- Merge classes with `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`.
- Default theme is dark; ensure new UI works in both light and dark mode.

## Data

- Site URL, external links, and project records: `lib/projects.ts` only.
- Do not scatter portfolio content across multiple files.

## Sections

- Homepage sections: `components/sections/*.tsx`, imported in `app/page.tsx`.
- Use `SectionHeading` for consistent section titles.
- Preserve navbar anchor IDs when editing section wrappers.

## Dependencies

- Package manager: **pnpm**.
- Avoid adding libraries when existing stack (Framer Motion, Radix, lucide-react) already covers the need.
